<view class="intro-page"><view class="intro-hero"><text class="intro-eyebrow">知鹿学习</text><text class="intro-title">从知识缺口到可执行的学习路径</text><text class="intro-copy">围绕学生当前年级、学科和知识点证据，逐步形成测评、诊断、学习计划、课程与复述验收的闭环。</text><button class="intro-primary pressable" bindtap="startAssessment">开始测评</button></view><view class="intro-section"><text class="intro-section__title">学习流程</text><view class="intro-flow"><view class="intro-flow__item"><view class="intro-flow__number">1</view><view><text class="intro-flow__title">测评与资料</text><text class="intro-flow__copy">结合学习档案、问卷、近期成绩和试卷信息建立初始学习证据。</text></view></view><view class="intro-flow__item"><view class="intro-flow__number">2</view><view><text class="intro-flow__title">学习宇宙</text><text class="intro-flow__copy">按年级和学科展示已掌握、需巩固与学习中的知识点。</text></view></view><view class="intro-flow__item"><view class="intro-flow__number">3</view><view><text class="intro-flow__title">学习计划</text><text class="intro-flow__copy">根据诊断结果和学习约束生成按依赖顺序组织的任务。</text></view></view><view class="intro-flow__item"><view class="intro-flow__number">4</view><view><text class="intro-flow__title">课程与验收</text><text class="intro-flow__copy">课程完成后由 AI 通过复述验收判定是否学会，并更新学习宇宙。</text></view></view></view></view><view class="intro-section"><text class="intro-section__title">先从这里开始</text><view class="intro-actions"><button class="intro-action surface pressable" bindtap="openKnowledgeMap"><image src="{{UA.src(ui, '/assets/icons/network.svg')}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>查看学习宇宙</text><text>测评与课程证据会持续累积</text></view><text>›</text></button><button wx:if="{{paymentOpen}}" class="intro-action surface pressable" bindtap="openProducts"><image src="{{UA.src(ui, '/assets/icons/wallet.svg')}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>知鹿会员</text><text>开通会员，全家孩子都能定制课程</text></view><text>›</text></button></view></view></view>
